
## Netflix landing page clone
## Brief / Problem

The goal was to recreate the Netflix landing page to improve my understanding of real-world UI structure, layout design, and responsive web development.

---

## Decisions & Why

I focused on a clean section-based layout using HTML and CSS because Netflix uses a structured, component-based design. I used Flexbox to ensure elements align properly across different screen sizes and kept styling minimal to match the original UI.

---

## Tools & Technologies + Learnings

- HTML  
- CSS  
- Flexbox  
- Responsive Design  

I learned how to structure complex layouts, manage spacing, and build responsive interfaces that adapt across devices.

---

## What I Would Do Differently + Proud Of

If I improve the project further, I would add JavaScript animations and enhance interactivity to make the experience feel more dynamic.

I am proud that I was able to closely replicate a real-world platform design and make it responsive across different screen sizes.